  "description": "There’s nothing quite like Wanderosa C Force X0 AXS Transmission. This full-suspension gravel ebike is as capable as they come, with an efficient carbon frame, 120mm front and 110mm rear suspension travel, and 29 x 2.2″ tires.\n\nFAZUA’s Ride 60 drive unit gives you the most out of every pedal stroke so you can spend more of your precious ride time in the saddle instead of hiking the steep bits or stopping to catch a breather. Our progressive gravel geometry makes all that saddle time more comfortable, no matter the terrain or speed. And smart on-bike cargo features let you load up for long days out when you want to explore every side road.\n\nSRAM’s Force X0 AXS Transmission is one of the most refined drivetrains out there, delivering fast, accurate shifts every time. All this adds up to make Wanderosa one special machine — see what you can do with the first-ever full-suspension gravel ebike.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
